{{Term/Store|Snowquill Headdress|Snowquill Headdresses|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Snowquill Headdresses can be purchased at the [[Brazen Beak]] in [[Rito Village]], alongside [[Snowquill Trousers]] and [[Snowquill Tunic]]s. All three of these clothing items are part of the [[Snowquill Set]], which makes [[Link]] unfreezable when worn together. Wearing a Snowquill Headdress on its own will grant Link one level of [[Cold Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

The Headdress can be both [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] and [[Enhancing|Enhance]]d at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].

